    "title": "Safia El Mammann named Big 12 Specialist of the Week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kimberlie Haner ,\n1 days ago IRVING, Texas – After winning two event titles at West Virginia over the weekend, freshman Safia El Mammann is this week’s Big 12 Specialist of the Week, the third weekly award this season for Sun Devil Gymnastics. This is El Mammann’s first career weekly award. For Arizona State,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
